    {
      "uid": "zhcn:de8081eb26b6c2a8cddea1ee",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "优秀素质为了追上摩耶重炮而往前冲，\n结果打乱了步调──\n只拿到第三名。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c34cdae98f1d663093a8126f961f2567ae81ae7ebef838b31fa7873a68322e2d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
